.TH DANBY-LAGRANGE1 1
.SH NAME
danby-lagrange1 \- motion near the triangular Lagrange points
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/lagrange1
.SH MODEL
Earth and Moon orbit their barycentre.  A station begins near L4 or L5 with a
selectable displacement and velocity perturbation.  The live trails expose the
bounded tadpole-like response possible near a stable triangular point.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/lagrange1.b
